    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Here, we focus on full-time in-office non-internship roles.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Identifying AI and Non-AI Jobs\n",
        "\n",
        "We identify AI/non-AI jobs by keyword searching.\n"
      ],
      "id": "8ec88558"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "keywords = ['AI', 'Artificial Intelligence', 'Machine Learning', 'Deep Learning',\n",
        "            'Data Science', 'Data Analysis', 'Data Analyst', 'Data Analytics',\n",
        "            'LLM', 'Language Model', 'NLP', 'Natural Language Processing',\n",
        "            'Computer Vision']\n",
        "\n",
        "match = lambda col: df[col].str.contains('|'.join(keywords), case=False, na=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "df['AI_JOB'] = match('TITLE_NAME') \\\n",
        "             | match('SKILLS_NAME') \\\n",
        "             | match('SPECIALIZED_SKILLS_NAME') \\\n",
        "             | match('LIGHTCAST_SECTORS_NAME')"
      ],
      "id": "e83bb280",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
